 - PDF"") ) ### Laboratory Safety: Centrifuges Quick Facts (2011)(**English:**[PDF](https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHAQUICKFACTS-LAB-SAFETY-CENTRIFUGES.pdf ""3406 - Laboratory Safety: Centrifuges Quick Facts - English - PDF"") ) ### Laboratory Safety: Chemical Fume Hoods Quick Facts (2011)(**English:**[PDF](https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHAQUICKFACTS-LAB-SAFETY-CHEMICAL-FUME-HOODS.pdf ""3407 - Laboratory Safety: Chemical Fume Hoods Quick Facts - English - PDF"") ) ### Laboratory Safety: Chemical Hygiene Plan (CHP) Fact Sheet (OSHA FS - 2011)(**English:**[PDF](https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHAFACTSHEET-LABORATORY-SAFETY-CHEMICAL-HYGIENE-PLAN.pdf ""3461 - Laboratory Safety: Chemical Hygiene Plan (CHP) Fact Sheet - English - PDF"") ) ### Laboratory Safety: Cryogens and Dry Ice Quick Facts (2011)(**English:**[PDF](https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHAQUICKFACTS-LAB-SAFETY-CRYOGENS-DRYICE.pdf ""3408 - Laboratory Safety: Cryogens and Dry Ice Quick Facts - English - PDF"") ) ### Laboratory Safety: Electrical Hazards Quick Facts (2011)(**English:**[PDF](https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHAQUICKFACTS-LAB-SAFETY-ELECTRICAL-HAZARDS.pdf ""3409 - Laboratory Safety: Electrical Hazards Quick Facts - English - PDF"") ) ### Laboratory Safety: Ergonomics for the Prevention of Musculoskeletal Disorders Fact Sheet (OSHA FS - 2011)(**English:**[PDF](https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHAFACTSHEET-LABORATORY-SAFETY-ERGONOMICS.pdf ""3462 - Laboratory Safety: Ergonomics for the Prevention of Musculoskeletal Disorders Fact Sheet - English - PDF"") ) ### Laboratory Safety: Labeling and Transfer of Chemicals Quick Facts (2011)(**English:**[PDF](https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHAQUICKFACTS-LAB-SAFETY-LABELING-CHEMICAL-TRANSFER.pdf ""3410 - Laboratory Safety: Labeling and Transfer of Chemicals Quick Facts - English - PDF"") ) ### Laboratory Safety: Latex Allergy Quick Facts (2011)(**English:**[PDF](https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHAQUICKFACTS-LAB-SAFETY-LATEX-ALLERGY.pdf ""3411 - Laboratory Safety: Latex Allergy Quick Facts - English - PDF"") ) ### Laboratory Safety: Noise Fact Sheet (OSHA FS - 2011)(**English:**[PDF](https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHAFACTSHEET-LABORATORY-SAFETY-NOISE.pdf ""3463 - Laboratory Safety: Noise Fact Sheet - English - PDF"") ) ### Laboratory Safety: OSHA Laboratory Standard Fact Sheet (OSHA FS - 2014)(**English:**[PDF](https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHAFACTSHEET-LABORATORY-SAFETY-OSHA-LAB-STANDARD.pdf ""3464 - Laboratory Safety: OSHA Laboratory Standard Fact Sheet - English - PDF"") ) ### Laboratory Safety: Working with Small Animals Quick Facts (2011)(**English:**[PDF](https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHAQUICKFACTS-LAB-SAFETY-WORKING-WITH-SMALL-ANIMALS.pdf ""3412 - Laboratory Safety: Working with Small Animals Quick Facts - English - PDF"") ) ### Preventing Adverse Health Effects from Exposure to Beryllium in Dental Laboratories (OSHA HIB 04-19-2002 - 2002)(**English:**[PDF](https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/HIB20020419.pdf ""HIB 04-19-2002 - Preventing Adverse Health Effects from Exposure to Beryllium in Dental Laboratories - PDF"") ) ### Zika Virus: Preventing and Managing Laboratory Worker Exposure to Zika Virus Fact Sheet (OSHA FS 3917 - 2017)(**English:**[PDF](https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHA3917.pdf ""3917 - Zika Virus: Preventing and Managing Laboratory Worker Exposure to Zika Virus Fact Sheet - English - PDF"") ) [Scroll to Top](https://www.osha.gov/publications/bytopic/laboratory-safety#) * [OSHA](https://www.osha.gov/aboutosha ""OSHA"") * [Standards](https://www.osha.gov/laws-regs ""Standards"") * [Enforcement](https://www.osha.gov/enforcement ""Enforcement"") * [Topics](https://www.osha.gov/a-z ""Topics"") * [Media Center