ty"") * [Communication](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/workplace-safety/communication) * [Identifying Hazards](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/workplace-safety/identifying-hazards-and-applying-controls) * [Job Safety Analysis](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/workplace-safety/job-safety-analysis) * [Safety by Campus Role](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/workplace-safety#safety-role) * [EH&S Inspections](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/workplace-safety/ehs-inspections) * [Department Safety Coordinators](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/department-safety-coordinators) * [Work Related Injuries](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/workplace-safety/work-related-injuries-and-illnesses) * [What to Do in an Emergency](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/workplace-safety/what-do-campus-emergency) * [Workplace Violence Prevention](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/uc-berkeley-workplace-violence-prevention) * [COVID-19](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/workplace-safety/covid-19 ""EH&S is working in partnership with the Office of Emergency Management, University Health Services (UHS), and campus leadership to help keep the UC Berkeley community healthy and safe."") * [Resources](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/resources-and-guides) * * [Overview](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/resources-and-guides) * [Resources & Guides](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/resources-and-guides) * [Recharge Services](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/recharge-services) * [Job Safety Analysis (JSA)](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/resources/job-safety-analysis-jsa-library) * [Fact Sheets](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/resources/fact-sheets) ## Secondary navigation * [Get PPE](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/personal-protective-equipment-ppe) * [Report a Safety Concern](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/node/97/) ## Laboratory & Research Safety ## ![Image 6: Lab Safety](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/sites/default/files/styles/panopoly_image_original/public/microscope-icon.png?itok=T50lHNbR&timestamp=1758820254)Working in Labs Providing support, in the form of[risk assessment](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/lab-hazard-assessment-tool-lhat), review,[consultation(link sends e-mail)](mailto:%20labsafety@berkeley.edu),[training](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/training), and the necessary[resources and guidance](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/resources-and-guides)for research at UC Berkeley. ![Image 7: Training](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/sites/default/files/styles/openberkeley_brand_widgets_thumbnail/public/general/photo-1486312338219-ce68d2c6f44d.jpg?itok=wvH1HR9M&timestamp=1604362258) ## [Register for Training](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/training#how) Register for trainings related to specific laboratory procedures and practices. ![Image 8](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/sites/default/files/styles/openberkeley_brand_widgets_thumbnail/public/ppe_labs_research_0.jpeg?itok=1VmBwa1B&timestamp=1595607095) ## [Get PPE](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/personal-protective-equipment-ppe-labs) Get lab coats, safety glasses, goggles, masks, face shields, and protective aprons. ![Image 9](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/sites/default/files/styles/openberkeley_brand_widgets_thumbnail/public/labs_sharps_disposal.jpg?itok=faH1A_ER&timestamp=1595607416) ## [Dispose of Waste](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/dispose-waste) Request pick up or drop off of lab waste. ![Image 10](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/sites/default/files/styles/openberkeley_brand_widgets_thumbnail/public/general/russinspector.jpg?itok=zwlCbXUV&timestamp=1588918575) ## [Lab Inspections](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/labs-research/lab-inspections) EH&S safety professionals inspect labs with biological and/or hazardous materials or operations. ![Image 11: Safety Data Sheets](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/sites/default/files/styles/openberkeley_brand_widgets_thumbnail/public/safety-data-sheet-photo-labs.jpg?itok=ntuGsfza&timestamp=1604362780) ## [Safety Data Sheets](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/safety-subject/hazardous-materials/safety-data-sheets) Safety data sheets are the best source of information regarding the hazards, emergency response, and protective measures for any hazardous material. ## [](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/research-safety)Lab Safety by Role [![Image 12](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/sites/default/files/styles/openberkeley_brand_widgets_rectangle/public/afo_208a.jpg?itok=g6Vav5NU) ## Laboratory Managers & Safety Coordinators](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/labs-research/lab-managers-safety-coordinators) [![Image 13](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/sites/default/files/styles/openberkeley_brand_widgets_rectangle/public/dsc_9490.jpg?itok=ru9Rkte-) ## Principal Investigators](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/labs-research/principal-investigators) [![Image 14](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/sites/default/files/styles/openberkeley_brand_widgets_rectangle/public/bluelabfinal-small.jpg?itok=HrnawF8N) ## Laboratory Workers & Students](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/labs-research/laboratory-workers-students) [![Image 15](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/sites/default/files/styles/openberkeley_brand_widgets_rectangle/public/uc_berkeley-40.jpg?itok=fQbA6B03) ## Department Safety Coordinators](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/department-safety-coordinators) ## Related Topics [Biological Safety topic page](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/topics/biological-safety), [Chemical Safety topic page](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/topics/chemical-safety), [Controlled Substances topic page](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/topics/controlled-substances), [Department Safety Coordinators topic page](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/topics/department-safety-coordinators), [Environmental Protection topic page](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/topics/environmental-protection), [Equipment and Tool Safety topic page](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/topics/equipment-and-tool-safety), [Fact Sheets topic page](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/topics/fact-sheets), [Fire Safety topic page](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/topics/fire-safety), [Hazardous Materials topic page](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/topics/hazardous-materials), [Job Safety Analysis topic page](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/topics/job-safety-analysis), [Lab Safety topic page](https://ehs.berkeley.edu/topics/lab-safety), [Laser Safety topic page](https:/