WEB7-012-001,UNC Laboratory Safety Program,lab_management,safety_guidance,general,3,general_safety;chemical,What baseline laboratory safety controls are required in the UNC laboratory safety program,What baseline laboratory safety controls are required in the UNC laboratory safety program有哪些要点？,"Title: Laboratory Safety - Environment, Health and Safety URL Source: https://ehs.unc.edu/topics/laboratory-safety/ Markdown Content: # Laboratory Safety - Environment, Health and Safety This website uses cookies and similar technologies to understand visitor experiences. By using this website, you consent to UNC-Chapel Hill's cookie usage in accordance with their [Privacy Notice](https://www.unc.edu/about/privacy-statement/). I Accept [skip to the end of the global utility bar](https://ehs.unc.edu/topics/laboratory-safety/#unc-search) [The University of North Carolina at Chapel Hill](http://www.unc.edu/) * [Accessibility](https://www.unc.edu/about/accessibility/) * [Events](https://www.unc.edu/events/) * [Libraries](http://library.unc.edu/) * [Maps](https://maps.unc.edu/) * [Departments](https://www.unc.edu/a-z/) * [ConnectCarolina](https://connectcarolina.unc.edu/) * [UNC Search](https://www.unc.edu/search) [skip to main](https://ehs.unc.edu/topics/laboratory-safety/#main) [Skip to main content](https://ehs.unc.edu/topics/laboratory-safety/#maincontent) [Environment, Health and Safety](https://ehs.unc.edu/) Campus Safety Submit Search Toggle navigation[Environment, Health and Safety](https://ehs.unc.edu/) * [About Environment, Health and Safety](https://ehs.unc.edu/about/) * [Departments](https://ehs.unc.edu/departments/) * [Topics](https://ehs.unc.edu/topics/) * [Safety Training](https://ehs.unc.edu/training/) * [Safety Committees](https://ehs.unc.edu/committees/) * [Manuals](https://ehs.unc.edu/manuals/) * [News](https://ehs.unc.edu/news/) 1. [Home](https://ehs.unc.edu/) 2. [Departments](https://ehs.unc.edu/departments/) 3. Laboratory Safety [](https://ehs.unc.edu/topics/laboratory-safety/) # Laboratory Safety Laboratory Safety inspects University laboratories to anticipate, recognize and control personnel exposures to workplace hazards. This section provides consulting services for laboratory safety concerns and manages the University Chemical Hygiene Plan. In addition, Laboratory Safety ensures compliance with the University’s [Laboratory Ventilation Policy](https://policies.unc.edu/TDClient/2833/Portal/KB/ArticleDet?ID=131973) and manages laboratory closeouts. If you suspect that a chemical fume hood in your laboratory is not operating properly, or if you are leaving the University or relocating your lab, please contact us. **Department Email** [chemsafety@ehs.unc.edu](mailto:chemsafety@ehs.unc.edu) [Staff Directory](https://ehs.unc.edu/about/staff/?department=laboratory-safety) [![Image 1: X](https://static.fo.unc.edu/images/socialmedia/social-media-contact-x.svg)**Laboratory Safety**](https://x.com/UNClabsafety) ## Related Topics * [![Image 2](https://ehs.unc.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/229/2022/11/laboratory-emergencies-150x150.png)Laboratory Emergencies](https://ehs.unc.edu/topics/laboratory-emergencies/) * [![Image 3](https://ehs.unc.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/229/2022/11/laboratory-equipment-150x150.png)Laboratory Equipment](https://ehs.unc.edu/topics/laboratory-equipment/) * [![Image 4](https://ehs.unc.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/229/2022/11/laboratory-safety-plan-150x150.png)Laboratory Safety Plan](https://ehs.unc.edu/topics/laboratory-safety-plan/) * [![Image 5](https://ehs.unc.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/229/2022/11/laboratory-personnel-150x150.png)Laboratory Personnel](https://ehs.unc.edu/topics/laboratory-personnel/) * [![Image 6](https://ehs.unc.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/229/2022/11/laboratory-upkeep-150x150.png)Laboratory Upkeep](https://ehs.unc.edu/topics/laboratory-upkeep/) * [![Image 7](https://ehs.unc.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/229/2022/11/personal-protective-equipment-150x150.png)Personal Protective Equipment](https://ehs.unc.edu/topics/personal-protective-equipment/) * [![Image 8](https://ehs.unc.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/229/2022/08/safety-label-signage-150x150.png)Safety Labels and Signage](https://ehs.unc.edu/topics/safety-labels-and-signage/) * [![Image 9](https://ehs.unc.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/229/2024/11/soldering-safety-150x150.png)Soldering Safety](https://ehs.unc.edu/topics/soldering-safety/) * [![Image 10](https://ehs.unc.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/229/2022/11/transporting-research-materials-150x150.png)Transporting Research Materials](https://ehs.unc.edu/topics/transporting-research-materials/) ## Safety Manuals * [Laboratory Safety Manual](https://ehs.unc.edu/manuals/laboratory/) ## Training * [Laboratory Safety Self-Study Units](https://ehs.unc.edu/training/self-study/?area=laboratory-safety) ## EHS Applications * [Lab Safety Plan](https://ehs.cloudapps.unc.edu/LabSafetyPlan/) * [Chemical Inventory](https://ehs.cloudapps.unc.edu/ChemInventory/) * [Worker Registration Form](https://ehs.cloudapps.unc.edu/LabRadWorker/) * [EHS Compliance Portal Login](https://ehs.cloudapps.unc.edu/EHS/) * [Hazardous Material/Waste Pick-up Request](https://ehs.cloudapps.unc.edu/HazMat_Pickup/) * [Lab Entrance Signage](https://ehs.cloudapps.unc.edu/EHS/?reqPage=LabSign) * [UEOHC Appointment System](https://ehs.cloudapps.unc.edu/UEOHC/) ## Forms * [Laboratory Safety Forms](https://ehs.unc.edu/departments/laboratory-safety/laboratory-safety-forms/) ## Resources ### General Resources * [OSHA Laboratory Safety Guidance](https://www.osha.gov/laboratories/safety-culture) * [Guidelines for Chemical Laboratory Safety in Academic Institutions(opens PDF in new window)](https://www.acs.org/content/dam/acsorg/about/governance/committees/chemicalsafety/publications/acs-safety-guidelines-academic.pdf) * [DCHAS Laboratory Risk Assessment (Video)](https://vimeo.com/279138365) * [Working in the Lab Alone (Video)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y8DBd45W4hY) * [ACS: Identifying and Evaluating Hazards in Research Laboratories(opens PDF in new window)](https://www.acs.org/content/dam/acsorg/about/governance/committees/chemicalsafety/publications/identifying-and-evaluating-hazards-in-research-laboratories.pdf) * [Prudent Practices in the Laboratory: Handling and Management of Chemical Hazards](https://nap.nationalacademies.org/catalog/4911/prudent-practices-in-the-laboratory-handling-and-disposal-of-chemicals), The National Academies Press 2011 Edition (free access online) ### Safety Culture Resources * [Safe Science: Promoting a Culture of Safety in Academic Chemical Research (2014)](https://www.nationalacademies.org/our-work/establishing-and-promoting-a-culture-of-safety-in-academic-laboratory-research?bname) * [APLU: A Guide to Implementing a Safety Culture in Our Universities](https://www.aplu.org/library/safety-culture/file) * [Creating Safety Cultures in Academic Institutions](https://www.acs.org/content/acs/en/education/students/graduate/creating-safety-cultures-in-academic-institutions.html) * [Chemical safety education for the 21st century — Fostering safety information competency in chemists](https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1871553217300865) ### Fact Sheets * [Preventing Cuts and Punctures in the Laboratory(opens PDF in new window)](https://ehs.unc.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/229/2022/11/preventing-cuts-and-punctures-in-the-laboratory.pdf) * [Ergonomics(opens PDF in new window)](https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHAfactsheet-laboratory-safety-ergonomics.pdf) * [Noise(opens PDF in new window)](https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHAfactsheet-laboratory-safety-noise.pdf) * [Working with Small Animals(opens PDF in new window)](https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHAquickfacts-lab-safety-working-with-small-animals.pdf) ## Page Navigation ### [Departments](https://ehs.unc.edu/departments/) * [Laboratory Safety](https://ehs.unc.edu/departments/laboratory-saf