y](https://ehs.stanford.edu/topic/field-research-safety) * [General Workplace Safety](https://ehs.stanford.edu/topic/general-workplace-safety) * [Hazardous Materials](https://ehs.stanford.edu/topic/hazardous-materials) * [Healthy Buildings](https://ehs.stanford.edu/topic/healthy-buildings) * [Institutional Biosafety Committee (IBC)](https://ehs.stanford.edu/topic/institutional-biosafety-committee-ibc) * [Lab Safety](https://ehs.stanford.edu/topic/lab-safety) * [Lab Setup and Shutdown](https://ehs.stanford.edu/topic/lab-setup-shutdown) * [Laser Safety](https://ehs.stanford.edu/topic/laser-safety) * [Occupational Health Center](https://ehs.stanford.edu/topic/occupational-health-center) * [Occupational Injury and Illness](https://ehs.stanford.edu/topic/occupational-injury-illness) * [Radiation Safety](https://ehs.stanford.edu/topic/radiation-safety) * [Respiratory Illness Policies](https://ehs.stanford.edu/topic/respiratory-illness-policies) * [Shop / Makerspace Safety](https://ehs.stanford.edu/topic/shop-makerspace-safety) * [Stanford University Fire Marshal’s Office (SUFMO)](https://ehs.stanford.edu/topic/fire-safety) * [Waste Disposal](https://ehs.stanford.edu/topic/waste-disposal) #### Quick Links * [Report an Incident (SU-17)](https://su17.stanford.edu/) * [COVID-19 Information](https://ehs.stanford.edu/topic/covid-19) * [Occupational Health Center](https://suohc.stanford.edu/) * [About Us](https://ehs.stanford.edu/about-us) * [BioRAFT](https://stanford.bioraft.com/) * [Chemical Inventory System](https://chemtracker.stanford.edu/v4) * [Find an EH&S Specialist](https://ehs.stanford.edu/staff) * [Lessons Learned](https://ehs.stanford.edu/reference?types=lesson%20learned) * [Recycling and Disposal Guide](https://ehs.stanford.edu/waste-streams) * [Register for Training](https://ehs.stanford.edu/training) * [Request Services](https://ehs.stanford.edu/service) * [Submit Work Request](https://ofweb.stanford.edu/apex/f?p=206) * [Waste Tag](https://wastetag.stanford.edu/) 